flowchart TD
    A[Teacher creates Class] --> B[System generates Join Code]
    B --> C[Student joins Class using Code]
    C --> D[Teacher starts Attendance Session]
    D --> E[System generates OTP & captures Teacher Location]
    E --> F[Student enters OTP]
    F --> G[System captures Student Location & Device ID]
    G --> H{Distance < Radius?}
    H -->|Yes| I{Device ID Match?}
    H -->|No| J[Reject - Too far]
    I -->|Yes| K[Mark Present]
    I -->|No| L[Reject - Device Locked]